 curses, and train upgrades, <strong>every run is totally unique!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/eb7f46a2db619b145e0cefc4ba7166ec.poster.avif?t=1771789124\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/eb7f46a2db619b145e0cefc4ba7166ec.webm?t=1771789124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by Josie Brechner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging single player mode,\u00a0with help from Frank the Automaton </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Long Lost"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/header.jpg?t=1771789124","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3195990/101630438/cfa427530c4f0022ccacf1d4f6300d695af6da0f/1765666114/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765666427","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3195990/101630438/cfa427530c4f0022ccacf1d4f6300d695af6da0f/1765666114/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765666427","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3195990/101630438/cfa427530c4f0022ccacf1d4f6300d695af6da0f/1765666114/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765666427","id":257249281,"name":"Rhyolite Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257249281/b7cd6cdb520a59a208a1bc85e3a7